{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9072xkry","slide":2,"text":"黑洞：一个引力特别强的地方","textPreview":"黑洞：一个引力特别强的地方","textChars":13,"textLines":1,"bbox":[74,80,910,62]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ozy1ofad","slide":2,"bbox":[74,150,112,5]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/b29kza94","slide":2,"bbox":[770,192,300,300]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/a10jqpsj","slide":2,"bbox":[810,232,220,220]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/x4r21kru","slide":2,"bbox":[680,220,480,240]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","slide":2,"bbox":[700,240,440,200]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r65knqtk","slide":2,"text":"强到连光都很难逃走","textPreview":"强到连光都很难逃走","textChars":9,"textLines":1,"bbox":[728,505,390,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q5wjelsz","slide":2,"text":"黑洞不是“吸尘器”，而是质量挤在很小空间里，形成极强引力的天体。","textPreview":"黑洞不是“吸尘器”，而是质量挤在很小空间里，形成极强引力的天体。","textChars":32,"textLines":1,"bbox":[84,220,540,130]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ove9o7yd","slide":2,"bbox":[84,402,500,116]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9wnqhczy","slide":2,"text":"“引力”就是把物体拉向彼此的力量。地球的引力让我们不会飘到太空中。","textPreview":"“引力”就是把物体拉向彼此的力量。地球的引力让我们不会飘到太空中。","textChars":33,"textLines":1,"bbox":[110,422,450,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mtwrmxg7","slide":2,"text":"关键词：引力","textPreview":"关键词：引力","textChars":6,"textLines":1,"bbox":[84,564,240,32]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slide":2,"text":"黑洞的特点是引力特别强。大家可以想象，把很重的东西压到很小很小的地方，周围的拉力就会变得很强。强到一定程度，连光也难以离开，所以我们看不见黑洞本身。\n\n科学参考：NASA Science, What Is a Black Hole? https://science.nasa.gov/universe/black-holes/"}
